n></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">article</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Title</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">}>维简设备采购计划&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Paragraph</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          本计划用于汇总各矿上报的设备需求，按&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Text</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> bold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>季度&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>汇总后提交审批。 需求单位须在</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Text</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> mark</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>每季度首月 10 日前&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>完成填报，逾期计入下一季度。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Paragraph</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Title</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">}>填报要求&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Paragraph</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          设备名称与型号须与台账一致，计量单位取字典值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Text</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>SCUI-UNIT&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          ，单价按&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Text</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> underline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>本次采购单价&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>填写，不得使用累计口径。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Paragraph</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Paragraph</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          模板下载见</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Link</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> href</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"#typography-prose-anchor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>采购计划模板&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Link</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          ，历史数据可从&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Text</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> delete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>旧版系统&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>迁移。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Paragraph</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">p</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"typography-prose-anchor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>锚点目标&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">article</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">DemoSection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>"
}
